  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.3.1: a collection offers hybrid search through GetService only with CreateBm25Indexes, where it can work: the TextSearchStore of Semantic Kernel, which chooses hybrid search through GetService, searches by vector again elsewhere, as with 0.2.0. 0.3.0: hybrid search on Chroma Cloud: HybridSearchAsync fuses the ranks of the vector search and of a BM25 search of the keywords; CreateBm25Indexes creates a BM25 index for each full-text indexed string property, and collections created by other Chroma clients with a chroma_bm25 index work too; it needs ChromaDotNet.Client 2.8.0, which reads in pages and writes in batches on Chroma Cloud by itself. 0.2.0: registration with the options of the client, like those of Chroma Cloud; reads in pages of the batch size of the client; the full-text property is also stored as the Chroma document, and Contains on it filters its text. 0.1.2: filters on the key; an existing collection with another space throws instead of giving wrong scores; empty lists are not stored; Contains over an empty list matches no record; a collection created again elsewhere is looked up again. 0.1.0: the first release. All the releases: https://github.com/ChromaDotNet/ChromaDB.VectorData/tags",
